        "suggested": {
            "title": "The Brand Machine: One Click From Idea to Posted Short",
            "description": "Building a content machine from scratch takes months — so I built a community where you get fully working ones, plus the skills to build your own. At the center is the Brand Machine: a daily news aggregator that feeds you content ideas from the channels you follow, then turns your notes or voice into a high-quality short with automatic video effects. Review it, hit post, and it goes out to every social at once.",
