    "transcript": {
        "duration": 54.0099983215332,
        "text": "for. Now building something like this is not easy, it took me some time to build my own and that's why I built this community. In this community you have access to fully built content machines like the ones you'll see after and you'll also learn how to build your own personalized content machines. Now talking about what matters the most and the reason most people join, it's our brand machine. So the brand machine is a system I've built that aggregates all the things you need to create a brand on your own. It starts with a daily news aggregator, a place where you can post channels and other socials that you follow and that can give you ideas for content. Then you can take this content, you can just type it or read it out loud and you can with one button click and you can generate a high quality short where you add the video effects automatically, where you just have to make sure everything is okay and you can click to post on all socials. We also have a section where you can turn your own content into shorts and even",
